        <headline>Lake Wind Advisory issued September 26 at 9:33AM PDT until September 26 at 8:00PM PDT by NWS Hanford CA</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...West winds 10 to 20 mph with gusts up to 30 mph expected.

* WHERE...Kern River Valley including Lake Isabella

* WHEN...From 2 PM this afternoon to 8 PM PDT this evening.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds and rough waves on area lakes will create
hazardous conditions for small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
